        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#3F51B5;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; Users &amp;amp; access&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#00897B;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; Catalogue &amp;amp; stock&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#EF6C00;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; Sales&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#546E7A;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;■&lt;/span&gt; Settings &amp;amp; audit&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;PK primary key · FK foreign key · UQ unique&lt;br&gt;Crow's foot: ┤ one · o┤ zero or one · &amp;gt;o zero or many&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#C62828&quot;&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; added in spec v0.4 (confirmed)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every table also has created_at and updated_at.&lt;br&gt;Money columns are INTEGER minor units (e.g. cents).&lt;br&gt;Times are TEXT (ISO 8601, UTC).&lt;br&gt;Records used by sales are deactivated, never deleted." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#F5F6FA;strokeColor=#C5CAE9;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1740" y="498" width="270" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
